SourceBadge distinguishes between direct landlord properties and multi-channel aggregated feeds.

## Usage

Use `SourceBadge` in card headers, search tables, and room detail screens to provide immediate provenance and trust cues to renters.

- `local`: Direct owner / platform verified listing.
- `nhatot`: Chợ Tốt Nhà syndicated listing.
- `batdongsan`: Batdongsan.com.vn syndicated listing.
- `phongtro123`: Phongtro123.com syndicated listing.
